Package: recoverome
Title: Infrastructure for Longitudinal Microbiome Recovery Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Francesc",
           family = "Catala-Moll",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "fcatala@irsicaixa.es",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2354-8648"))
Description: Registers named longitudinal microbiome recovery analyses in
    'TreeSummarizedExperiment' objects. Validates explicit sample membership,
    episodes, event origins, and numeric time coordinates, recording original
    scope and provenance while preserving the container. Diagnoses registration
    consistency, analytical input and output dependencies, and historical scope
    without modifying data.
    Attaches explicit personal reference profiles from selected baseline samples,
    recording their support and input provenance. Computes sample deviations
    from fixed personal references while preserving historical results.
    Recovery classification remains planned.
